---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Ask from '../components/Ask.astro';

const mistakes = [
  { num: 'I', h: 'Treating the ferry like a train',
    p: 'Greek ferries are wonderful &mdash; and they answer to the sea, not the timetable. In July and August the meltemi wind sweeps the Aegean, and sailings get delayed or cancelled with a few hours&rsquo; notice. Couples who booked the last boat of the day, on the last day of the trip, learn this the hard way.',
    instead: 'Book morning departures on the fast boats, reserve seats the moment your dates are set for summer travel, and fly any leg where a flight exists. The sea is for lazy afternoons, not tight connections.' },
  { num: 'II', h: 'Assuming a taxi will be waiting',
    p: 'On Santorini, only a few dozen taxis cover the entire island &mdash; and on cruise-ship days they might as well not exist. The ferry port funnels every arriving boat up one switchback road at once. And if your suite sits on the caldera, the last stretch to your door is a footpath with steps no car can touch.',
    instead: 'Have a private driver confirmed to your exact arrival, with a porter from the hotel meeting you for the bags. You step off the boat, someone says your name, and the hard part is over before it starts.' },
  { num: 'III', h: 'Packing the itinerary too tight',
    p: 'Three islands in seven nights sounds romantic until you&rsquo;re spending every other day in transit &mdash; pack, check out, port, boat, port, check in, repeat. The most common regret I hear isn&rsquo;t the island a couple skipped. It&rsquo;s the hours they lost moving between the ones they kept. Worst of all: a same-day ferry connecting to the international flight home, with zero margin if the wind picks up.',
    instead: 'Three nights minimum per island, two islands maximum for a week. Consider the half-hour helicopter hop to buy back a full day. And spend your final night in Athens &mdash; a last great dinner beats a nervous morning at the port.' },
];
---
<Layout
  canonical="three-mistakes-greek-islands.html"
  title="3 Mistakes Couples Make Between the Greek Islands | Suites With Keith"
  description="The hotels get all the attention. The days between them are where honeymoons quietly go sideways — and where they're easiest to save."
  preload="/images/islands/mykonos-divider.jpg"
  current="guides"
>

<!-- hero -->
<header class="hero" style="min-height:min(66svh,600px);">
  <img class="hero-img" src="/images/islands/mykonos-divider.jpg" alt="Boats in the harbor at Mykonos" width="1800" height="1200" fetchpriority="high" />
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Greek islands &middot; travel planning</p>
    <h1 class="display-l" style="margin-top:18px; max-width:20ch; color:var(--band-ink); font-size:clamp(2rem,4.6vw,3.4rem);">3 mistakes couples make between the islands</h1>
    <p class="sub" style="margin-top:16px;">The hotels get all the attention. The days between them are where honeymoons quietly go sideways &mdash; and where they&rsquo;re easiest to save.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- mistakes -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
    {mistakes.map((m) => (
      <article class="mist reveal">
        <span class="mist-num" set:html={m.num} />
        <div>
          <h2 class="display-m" style="font-size:clamp(1.35rem,2.4vw,1.7rem);" set:html={m.h} />
          <p class="body-2" style="margin-top:12px;" set:html={m.p} />
          <div class="instead">
            <p class="stamp plain" style="font-weight:700; color:var(--brass); margin-bottom:8px;">Do this instead</p>
            <p set:html={m.instead} />
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>

<Ask
  subject="Map My Greece Transfers"
  page="three-mistakes-greek-islands"
  eyebrow="Already booked your honeymoon?"
  heading="Send me your dates. I&rsquo;ll handle the rest."
  placeholder="Santorini & Mykonos, June 10–20"
  deck="Tell me your hotel and dates, and I&rsquo;ll map every transfer &mdash; drivers, porters, ferries, even the helicopter &mdash; and layer in partner perks at your hotel. Complimentary, without changing your reservation."
  dark
/>

</Layout>

<style>
  .mist { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 70px 1fr; gap: 24px; padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
  .mist:first-of-type { border-top: none; padding-top: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .mist { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; } }
  .mist-num { font-family: var(--display); font-style: italic; font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--brass); line-height: 1; }
  .instead { background: var(--lime); border-left: 2px solid var(--brass); padding: 18px 22px; margin-top: 18px; }
  .instead p:last-child { font-size: .95rem; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.65; }
</style>
